# Colourings

Do not add a new colouring method in this repository. Add it in MetaMetro and open a pull request there.

Do not mock a colouring. Train on colour columns MetaMetro already wrote.

Check that a selected colouring exists on the current ToCUMG or CGT. If it is missing, stop.

Use MetaMetro colourings and `filter_colours` / `load_bench_cgt` to keep the layers an arm needs.
